    ---
    import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
    import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
    import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
    import FloatingContainer from '../components/FloatingContainer.astro';
    import Spotlight from "../components/Spotlight.astro";
    import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

    import logoDLSU from '../assets/DLSU-logo.png';
    import logoLetran from '../assets/logoLetran.webp';

    import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
    ---

    <!doctype html>
    <html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <main class="education-page">
        <div class="glow-layer" aria-hidden="true">
                <Spotlight color="rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35)" size="400px" />
        </div>
        <div class="background-container">
            <div class="education-header">
                <h1>Education</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="education-item">
                <FloatingContainer
                header="De La Salle University"
                subHeader1="Bachelor of Science in Computer Engineering"
                subHeader2="Manila, Philippines • Expected Graduation: 2023-2027 • CGPA: 3.359"
                centered={true}
                >
                    <div slot="top">
                        <Image src={logoDLSU} alt="DLSU Logo" width={100} height={100} />
                    </div>
                    <div slot="content">
                        <p>
                        Starting in my second year, I began to engage with extracurricular organizations, specifically the Laguna Campus Engineering College Government (LCECG) and the DLSU Laguna Lasallian Ambassadors. Through these groups, I developed foundational leadership, organizational skills, and team-wide collaboration.
                        <br /><br />
                        In my third year, I accepted an executive board position within the DLSU Laguna Lasallian Ambassadors as the Core for Documentation and Publicity. This role led me to new leadership opportunities, allowing me to participate in university-wide event planning and preparation.
                        <br /><br />
                        Alongside my extracurricular activities, I actively engaged in engineering and research work through my coursework and laboratories. Topics explored ranged from electronics, programming, and embedded systems engineering to hardware design and machine learning using TensorFlow and Keras.
                        <br /><br />
                        </p>
                        <h4>Relevant Coursework:</h4>
                        <h5>Term 10, AY 2026-2027</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Deep Learning Systems (CpE Elective 2)</li>
                            <li>Computer Networks and Security</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 9, AY 2025-2026</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Digital Signal Processing</li>
                            <li>Computer Vision Systems (CpE Elective 1)</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 8, AY 2025-2026</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Computer Architecture and Organization</li>
                            <li>Embedded Systems</li>
                            <li>Operating Systems</li>
                            <li>Methods of Research</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 7, AY 2025-2026</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Microprocessors</li>
                            <li>Computer Engineering Drafting and Design</li>
                            <li>Intelligent Systems Engineering</li>
                            <li>Hardware Design Language Laboratory</li>
                            <li>Data and Digital Communications</li>
                            <li>Basic Computer Systems Administration</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 6, AY 2024-2025</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Feedback and Control Systems</li>
                            <li>Logic Circuits and Design</li>
                            <li>Fundamentals of Mixed Signals and Sensors</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 5, AY 2024-2025</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Feedback and Control Systems</li>
                            <li>Logic Circuits and Design</li>
                            <li>Fundamentals of Mixed Signals and Sensors</li>
                            <li>Software Design</li>
                            <li>Fundamentals of Electronic Circuits</li>
                            <li>Numerical Methods</li>
                            <li>Engineering Data Analysis</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 4, AY 2024-2025</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Fundamentals of Electrical Circuits</li>
                            <li>Data Structures and Algorithms</li>
                            <li>Chemistry for Engineers</li>
                            <li>Differential Equations</li>
                        </ul>
                        <h5>Term 3, AY 2023-2024</h5>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Physics for Engineers</li>
                            <li>Differential Calculus</li>
                            <li>Integral Calculus</li>
                            <li>Programming Logic and Design</li>
                            <li>Computer Fundamentals and Programming</li>
                            <li>Object Oriented Programming</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </FloatingContainer>
            </div>
            <div class="education-item">
                <FloatingContainer
                header="Colegio de San Juan de Letran-Calamba"
                subHeader1="Senior High School • STEM Strand"
                subHeader2="Calamba, Philippines • Graduated: 2021-2023"
                centered={true}
                >
                <div slot="top">
                    <Image src={logoLetran} alt="Letran Logo" width={100} height={100} />
                </div>
                    <div slot="content">
                        <p>
                        <strong>Graduated With High Honors and awarded Best in Research</strong> for the Capstone title: "FRETSCO: Freshwater Trash Collector and Monitoring System" in developing a mobile robotics system for freshwater environmental debris collection and real-time monitoring.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </FloatingContainer>
            </div>
        </div>
        </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
    </html>

    <style>
    html,
    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        width: 100%;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        background: #ffffff;
    }

    /* Overrides global.css's 720px width and auto margin on <main> */
    main.education-page {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        background: #0f172a;
    }

    .background-container {
        z-index: 1;
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .glow-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }

    .glow-layer :global(.spotlight) {
        height: 100%;
    }

    .education-header {
        text-align: center;
    }

    .education-header h1 {
        margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .education-item {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 720px;
        box-sizing: border-box;

        transition:
		transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
		box-shadow 0.35s ease;
		will-change: transform;
    }

    .education-item:hover {
		transform: scale(1.02);
		box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
	}

    :global(footer) {
        width: 100%;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        background: #ffffff;
    }
    </style>